flowchart TD

    %% PROGRAM DISCOVERY
    A[Site: List active programs and allow calendar selection]
    B[User: Search programs by location, season, price, description]
    C[Record DB: Return filtered programs]
    D[User: Select program]

    A --> B --> C --> D

    %% SESSION FILTERING
    E[User: Filter sessions by time, coach, description]
    F[Record DB: Return sessions with available capacity]

    D --> E --> F

    %% REGISTRATION FLOW
    G[User: Request to join session]
    H{Has the member swum before}

    F --> G --> H

    %% YES PATH
    H -->|Yes| I[Proceed to invoice]

    %% NO PATH
    H -->|No| J[Fill and sign PDF forms]
    J --> K[User: Completed forms]

    %% MERGE
    I --> L[User: Pay invoice online]
    K --> L

    %% FINAL OUTPUT
    M[Site: Send welcome email, rules email, rescheduling info]

    L --> M

    %% SYSTEM UPDATES
    N[Record DB: Register user]
    O[Admin: Notify of new signup]

    M --> N --> O
